{{fbdoc item="title" value="__FB_ENTRY__"}}----
Intrinsic define (macro string) set by the compiler

{{fbdoc item="syntax"}}##
	""__FB_ENTRY__""
##
{{fbdoc item="desc"}}
	Defined as a string literal containing the custom entry point specified with [[CompilerOptentry|-entry]]. It is an empty string when no custom entry point was specified.

{{fbdoc item="ver"}}
	- Since fbc 1.20.4

{{fbdoc item="see"}}
	- [[CompilerOptentry|Compiler Option: -entry]]

